{"articleNo":"1431","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1431&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"성희롱, 성폭력 예방교육","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.04.07","hit":"11773","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><br><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\n<p align=\"left\"><br><strong>우리대학 학생 및 교직원들의 성희롱, 성폭력 예방의식을 함양하고 대처능력을 강화하여 밝고 건전한<br><br>대학환경을&nbsp;조성하기 위하여 다음과 같이 성희롱(성폭력), 성매매 예방교육을 실시하오니 많은&nbsp;시청바랍니다.</strong><br><br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 대 상 : <u><strong><font color=\"#000080\">학생 및 교직원(교수포함)</font></strong><br></u><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 제 목 : 함께하는 대학 행복한 시작<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 내 용 : <font color=\"#808000\"><strong><u>성희롱의 정의,</u> <u>대학내 외부 성희롱 사건처리 및 구제절차,</u> <u>성희롱 대처요령 등<br><br></u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong><u>성희롱&nbsp;예방 및 구제관련</u> <u>전반에 걸친 주요사항</u></strong></font>&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 라. 방 법 : 학교 홈페이지 동영상 교육<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 마. 동영상 제작 기관 : 여성가족부<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 바. 교육시간 : 28분<br><br><br><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011. 04.&nbsp;01<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학 생 처 장&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span></strong><br></p>\n</span></font>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
